ode.py:52:#      instead of a point. Samples contain multiple blue crosses, multiple maroon singleton\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/17/code.py:56:#      other crosses, or singleton maroon cells. This keeps the scene legible despite the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/17/code.py:60:#      maroon marks lone bg impacts. No hidden color ordering or arithmetic is used.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/17/code.py:223:    - If a projectile lands on a sprite, the entire struck sprite is recolored maroon (9).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/17/code.py:224:    - If multiple projectiles land on the same empty background cell, that collision becomes a blue (1) cross centered there; a lone empty-bg landing becomes a single maroon (9) cell.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/20/code.py:25:#      orthogonal wire permutation and optional maroon 9-rect junctions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/20/code.py:470:    \"\"\"Attempt to replace a wire segment block with a maroon pass-through rectangle.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/15/code.py:228:    - In either batch, landing on any current non-background component recolors that whole component to maroon (9); landing on empty background paints maroon (9) for one shooter or blue (1) for multiple shooters in that same batch.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/9/code.py:25:      - 仍然使用原题的条纹布局: 偶数行为横条行, 奇数行为水平通道行, 第0列全是粒子, 第1列全是背景.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/9/code.py:27:      - 新增对象是“走廊内孤立阻挡块”: 放在真实水平通道里, 自身是单格彩色像素, 视觉上区别于长条.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/9/code.py:33:        - 粒子在真实水平通道内向右走.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/9/code.py:35:        - 异色通道只是背景噪声, 即使经过相关区域附近也不会因为“假”而停.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/9/code.py:37:        - 粒子在真实水平通道里先撞到一个单格阻挡块, 这一步复用原题的“前方有彩色格就尝试转弯”.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9