/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D13/1/code.py:55:#   - The centered coarse 2x2 maroon block occupies rows 2..3 and cols 2..3 of the 6x6 macro\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D13/1/code.py:56:#     raster, yielding a centered 6x6 maroon-bbox in the 18x18 final output.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D13/1/code.py:67:#   - Colors remain structurally simple: orange marks phase-lattice cells, maroon marks the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D13/1/code.py:147:    - Build a coarse 6x6 lattice by tiling that phase tile and overwrite the centered coarse 2x2 block with maroon.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D13/1/code.py:148:    - Expand each coarse pixel into a 3x3 child tile shaped like the input glyph: orange cells become orange glyph tiles, maroon cells become maroon glyph tiles, and black cells stay black.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D13/2/code.py:25:#     - centered 6x6 maroon stamp made by 2x2 tiling the 3x3 glyph\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D13/2/code.py:43:#       -> stamp the centered maroon 2x2 motif\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D13/2/code.py:55:#   - stamping must happen after erasing; otherwise the erase step would clip maroon pixels and blur the two-stage logic.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D13/2/code.py:61:#   - the output keeps only black/orange/maroon, so the new effect is silhouette-based and clean.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D13/2/code.py:63:#   - only two layers remain in the lattice region (orange on black), plus the central maroon stamp.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D13/2/code.py:131:    - Erase the tiled lattice outside that window, then tile the original 3x3 glyph 2x2 and recolor its true pixels to maroon in the centered 6x6 region.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D6/0/code.py:18:#      2. a centered 6x6 maroon stamp made by tiling the original 3x3 glyph 2x2\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D6/0/code.py:31:#                  more separated lattice. The center 6x6 maroon H-stamp is unchanged.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D6/0/code.py:61:#    - Only two layers exist in the output: the periodic orange/black lattice and the central maroon stamp.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D6/0/code.py:66:#      Output still uses only black, orange, and maroon.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D6/0/code.py:112:    Read the 3x3 contour glyph as both a phase-shape code and a period code, then build the repeated lattice with the glyph stamped in maroon at the center.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D6/0/code.py:123:    - Tile the original 3x3 glyph 2x2 and recolor its true pixels to maroon inside the centered 6x6 region.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D6/2/code.py:18:#       color: any single color except black(0), orange(7), maroon(9)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D6/2/code.py:23:#     stamp: the original 4x4 motif tiled 2x2 into an 8x8 maroon center block\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D6/2/code.py:24:#     colors_used: black(0), orange(7), maroon(9)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D6/2/code.py:36:#        output       = repeat that 3x3 tile, then stamp a 6x6 maroon 2x2 copy.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D6/2/code.py:40:#        output       = repeat that 4x4 tile on 16x16, then stamp an 8x8 maroon 2x2 copy.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D6/2/code.py:76:#      maroon stamp. No extra markers or overlapping annotation channels are added.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D6/2/code.py:81:#      Output colors stay restricted to black/orange/maroon, exactly as in the base task.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D6/2/code.py:168:    Decode the colored 4x4 contour motif into a 16x16 period-4 lattice and stamp a centered maroon 2x2 copy of that motif.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D6/2/code.py:178:    - Tile the original 4x4 glyph 2x2 and recolor its true pixels to maroon in the centered 8x8 region.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D5/0/code.py:3:# Change: 形状补全（shape_completion）——如果管道一端已存在十字形或四角星形，则在另一端放置互补形状（四角星对应十... → 叠加合并补全\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D5/1/code.py:3:# Change: 形状补全（shape_completion）——如果管道一端已存在十字形或四角星形，则在另一端放置互补形状（四角星对应十字，十字对应四角星），颜色与已有形状相同 → 颜色变换补全\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D5/1/code.py:26:#   complementary shape: its color is offset by how many maroon 9-rectangles the routed wire passes.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D5/1/code.py:279:      color is increased by the number of maroon 9-rectangles that path passes through.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D14/2/code.py:26:#      stamp one maroon 2x2 motif at the center.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D14/2/code.py:29:#      and the later bbox layer second -> stamp the union of the two 2x2 motifs in maroon.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D14/2/code.py:46:#      maroon \"stamp\" idea is preserved by taking the union after 2x2 tiling.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D14/2/code.py:55:#    There are only two lattice colors plus black and the single maroon center stamp. The\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D14/2/code.py:151:    Decode two colored contour glyphs into stacked periodic lattices, then seal their combined motif as a centered maroon stamp.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D14/2/code.py:161:    - Composite the two repeated layers so the later bbox in row-major order overwrites the earlier one, then stamp the 2x2-tiled union of both glyphs in maroon inside the centered 6x6 window.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D5/3/code.py:3:# Change: 形状补全（shape_completion）——如果管道一端已存在十字形或四角星形，则在另一端放置互补形状（四角星对应十... → 擦除源+完整传送\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D10/1/code.py:26:#     output_grid: 16x16 periodic lattice plus centered 6x6 maroon 2x2 stamp of the glyph\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D10/1/code.py:45:#     looks like black square holes separated by orange lattice lines. The 6x6 maroon center stamp is unchanged.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D10/1/code.py:50:#     center_stamp: unchanged and still overlays maroon on top of either orange or black cells\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D10/1/code.py:61:#     - center overwrite with maroon: still safe because maroon is a dedicated overlay color and the center region\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D10/1/code.py:74:#       maroon = centered stamp.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D10/1/code.py:111:    Decode the colored 3x3 contour glyph into a 16x16 periodic lattice whose orange/black roles are inverted, then stamp the glyph in maroon at the center.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D10/1/code.py:121:    - Tile the original 3x3 motif 2x2 into a centered 6x6 region and recolor the motif pixels to maroon.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D5/2/code.py:3:# Change: 形状补全（shape_completion）——如果管道一端已存在十字形或四角星形，则在另一端放置互补形状（四角星对应十字，十字对应四角星），颜色与已有形状相同 → 镜像翻转补全\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D11/2/code.py:20:#     into a 2x2 maroon block, yielding a 6x6 coarse stamp\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D11/2/code.py:37:#   - the difference is human-visible in 2-3 examples because repeated seams disappear and contiguous 2x2 maroon blocks appear\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D11/2/code.py:41:#   - colors remain black/orange/maroon in the output; no new color mapping is introduced, so the only new inference is geometric\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D11/2/code.py:93:    Decode the 3x3 contour glyph into a periodic orange lattice and stamp a magnified maroon version at the center.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D11/2/code.py:103:    - Recolor the glyph to maroon and enlarge each of its pixels into a 2x2 solid block, producing a centered 6x6 stamp.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D9/0/code.py:10:#     - 颜色 8/5/9 的导线网络、crossing 标记、9 矩形通道、置换式路由全部保留。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D9/0/code.py:11:#     - token 仍然放在导线端点外侧 2 格处，使用各通道独立颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D9/0/code.py:34:#     - 仍保留 4-5 条通道、非恒等置换、crossing 与 9 矩形，使任务复杂度主要仍来自配线追踪，而不是 token 识别噪声。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D9/0/code.py:41:#     - 不同通道颜色互异，token 之间不会重叠；输出端也是既定 top/bottom 锚点，不覆盖导线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D7/1/code.py:123:    Decode the colored 3x3 contour motif into a 16x16 periodic lattice with the motif stamped in maroon at the center.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D7/1/code.py:133:    - Fill the 16x16 canvas with that phase tile, then stamp a 2x2 maroon tiling of the glyph into the centered 6x6 region.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D9/3/code.py:36:#       avoids covering crossings or maroon junction rectangles.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/0/code.py:43:#    - 仍保留大部分 8 号竖线和少量 5 号普通直穿标记；9 号块只替换少数关键交叉，不让整张图变成大块 maroon 噪声。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/0/code.py:282:    Route endpoint tokens through pipe networks whose maroon rectangles act as quarter-turn mirrors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/1/code.py:234:    - The background is the dominant color. Other cells form cyan wires, optional maroon rectangular junction blocks, and colored 3x3 tokens positioned two cells away from wire endpoints.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/221dfab4/D12/0/code.py:24:#    means pink, pink, orange; a teal source means teal, teal, maroon; a green source\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/221dfab4/D12/0/code.py:71:    8: 9,  # teal -> maroon\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/2/code.py:8:#    - 原题的交叉行本质上是“一个水平转接槽穿过若干竖直通道”；5 只是视觉提示，solver 几乎不读取它。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/2/code.py:14:#      因而同一条水平槽上红蓝序列会改变通道排列，输入/输出里能直接看到颜色-行为映射。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/2/code.py:25:#    - 通道列间距维持 4-5，保证 marker 对 (c-1,c+1) 不会与相邻交叉重叠。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D2/2/code.py:309:    - Background cells surround orthogonal wire networks, optional maroon 9-rect pass-through blocks,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/22/code.py:55:#     - 每个障碍像素都必须位于某束初始光线的命中通道内，保证该方向的首碰是可达的。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/22/code.py:56:#     - 二次碰撞链通过几何相容性构造：首碰像素放得足够靠近光源，使转向后的 sz 宽通道能扫到目标像素。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D8/0/code.py:15:#      wires are still 8/5 networks, and maroon 9-regions are still embedded rectangles.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D8/0/code.py:16:#    - The new observable effect is on the transmitted far-end token only. A maroon rectangle\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D8/0/code.py:47:#    - The rule is visible without using hidden ids: channels that cross a maroon rectangle produce\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D8/0/code.py:48:#      the same rest-shape on both ends; channels that avoid maroon keep the original complementary\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D8/0/code.py:265:    Transmit colored tokens through wire networks while maroon rectangles invert the outbound motif.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D8/0/code.py:278:      the parity of encountered maroon rectangles controls whether the transmitted complement flips.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/31/code.py:3:# Name: 直线射线+边缘停止+稀疏窄通道\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D8/1/code.py:14:#    wire endpoints, teal/grey wires route colors across the grid, and maroon rectangles remain\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D8/1/code.py:15:#    embedded inside those wires. The change is only the role of the maroon rectangle.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D8/1/code.py:24:#    If its route contains a 2x3 maroon rectangle (area 6), the bottom endpoint still receives\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D8/1/code.py:25:#    an X. If the route instead contains a 3x3 maroon rectangle (area 9), the bottom endpoint\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D8/1/code.py:48:#    inspect maroon rectangles and compare examples where a 2x2 / 2x3 rectangle still lets the far\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D8/1/code.py:253:    Route endpoint tokens across the wire network while maroon rectangles act as parity gates.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D8/1/code.py:268:    - The maroon rectangle is no longer just a connector. Its width-by-height parity is the gate,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/29/code.py:19:#    with grey/orange interiors, one adjacent maroon head line, and one same-color\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D1/0/code.py:18:#    - 删除原题输入里的青色管道和灰色 crossing 标记；中部改成若干条横向 maroon(9) 墙带，每条墙带只留一个小缺口。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/18/code.py:12:     a 1-cell-thick maroon head line on one side, and a same-shaped maroon\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/18/code.py:77:   - The no_head decoy leaves only one maroon line on its axis, avoiding marker\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D1/1/code.py:260:    - The background is the most common color. Non-background cells form cyan pipe networks, optional maroon\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/25/code.py:19:#   再在黑框外找 maroon 线，并按“同色同形”找到 dest。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D1/3/code.py:10:#    - 这个变体把“保持方向”变成不可靠：主通道列改为整列贯通，因此在发生换道的行上，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D1/3/code.py:12:#      如果还沿用原 solver 的 greedy-straight，就会在这些点继续向下/向上，走错通道。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D1/3/code.py:23:#    - 一个具体小例子：假设某颜色 token 从第 2 列通道要被送到第 4 列通道。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D1/3/code.py:40:#      这些在新变体中都不成立，因为主通道列是连续竖线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D1/3/code.py:52:#    - 主通道列全部贯通，横向 crossover row 之间至少隔 2 行；这样对角箭头装饰不会压到另一条横线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/1/code.py:9:#    - 融合后，蓝色不再代表“任意可拐弯通道”，而是若干对角线 n×n 放置状态的并集。黑块从起点沿唯一的\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/1/code.py:14:#    - 这与原题的差异是决定性地把“位置”改成了“位置 + 对角方向”，并把“通道自己允许拐弯”改成了“镜面显式触发反射”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/26/code.py:47:#   Original task: move NW by 3, recolor 3 grey cells, head stays maroon on destination.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/26/code.py:49:#   maroon, and because the destination is fully reached, turn the final 2-pixel head/destination pair\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/26/code.py:71:# - Original writeback assumed vacated cells become background and the final head always stays maroon.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/26/code.py:85:#   row and column both change, the box leaves a maroon diagonal corridor, and a full contact turns the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/26/code.py:86:#   final marker pair black instead of maroon.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/26/code.py:97:#   grey->orange by charge order, and maroon->black only on full docking.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/27/code.py:9:#      black rectangular containers 0, striped orange/grey interiors 7/5, a maroon\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/27/code.py:10:#      head line 9 attached to one side, and a matching maroon destination line on\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/27/code.py:52:#    - Humans can see three coupled effects at once: motion toward the maroon target,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/27/code.py:64:#      maroon marks head/destination, and magenta is background.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/11/code.py:3:# Name: 多目标选择+分支通道\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D3/0/code.py:19:#         9: 矩形通道块；变体中不再始终保留 9，而是按 token 在块内的实际穿越条带被染色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D3/0/code.py:35:#     - 保留 4-5 个通道、非恒等置换、0-3 个 9-rect，使样例中有重复证据支持“彩色轨迹就是路由”\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/8/code.py:19:# - The outer object is still a black rectangular frame with a full-edge maroon head line and an\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/8/code.py:20:#   aligned maroon destination line.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D3/1/code.py:291:    - Background cells surround a connected cyan/grey/maroon wire network plus 3x3\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/14/code.py:82:#       Grey means \"not flipped\" and maroon means \"flipped\".\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/269e22fb/14/code.py:88:#       1. Read the 2x2 hint block first. Example: a maroon square says the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D3/3/code.py:17:#   from red near the source, through grey then maroon, back to red near the arrival end.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/1/code.py:50:#    - No extra color mapping is introduced: maroon already denotes \"head/target\", and in the output\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/1/code.py:51:#      the same maroon marks the traversed diagonal path. The only inference is that the vacated\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/3/code.py:28:  grey/orange; a maroon head line attached to one side; an equal maroon destination line farther\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/3/code.py:72:- In the fused scene the maroon destination stays farther away, yet the output head stops before it\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/35/code.py:3:# Name: 多体顺序移动+环形通道+一对多目标\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/35/code.py:8:#    原题只有一个 mover 和一个目标，蓝色通道也是单链，所以“走到目标”与“沿唯一通道一直前进”几乎是同一件事。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/35/code.py:13:#    - 蓝色通道是一个矩形环，mover 从左侧支路进入，3 个目标挂在环的其它支路上。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D12/0/code.py:3:# Change: 混合输入——大部分通道以实心3x3块作为输入token，0-2个通道以X形作为输入token；X形通道的远端约67%留空... → 全部实心输入\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D12/0/code.py:16:#   grey crossing markers (5), optional maroon pass-through rectangles (9), and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D12/3/code.py:3:# Change: 混合输入——大部分通道以实心3x3块作为输入token，0-2个通道以X形作为输入token；X形通道的远端约67%留空... → 不完整token（残缺3x3块）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D12/3/code.py:11:#   - X token 保持原样，仍然是 0-2 个通道出现的对角线+中心形状；它们的远端仍可为空或预放 diamond。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D12/3/code.py:45:#   - 每个非 X 通道都使用残缺 solid，而不是偶尔仍给完整 solid；这样 2-4 个样例中一定能看到变体。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/7/code.py:25:# - The target is no longer a same-shape marker. It is a single maroon point placed farther ahead\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D12/2/code.py:3:# Change: 混合输入——大部分通道以实心3x3块作为输入token，0-2个通道以X形作为输入token；X形通道的远端约67%留空... → 双端部分形状输入\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/40/code.py:3:# Name: 渐变色轨迹+裁剪通道内部\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/71e489b6/32/code.py:289:    - Black regions may also contain isolated single-pixel noise specks in several other colors (for example red, green, yellow, teal, or maroon) rather than only blue.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D4/0/code.py:3:# Change: 分解（decomposition）——实心3x3块被分解为十字形（中心+4个正交邻居，留在原位）和四角星形（4个对角角，... → 反向分解（对角留、正交走）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D4/0/code.py:24:#    - 保留原题的 4-5 条通道、非恒等置换、0-3 个 9-矩形、0-2 个 X 输入，避免变体退化成简单的\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D4/0/code.py:25:#      单边复制题。多数通道仍使用 solid 输入，因此“solid -> 原地 X / 远端 diamond”会在每个样本里重复出现。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D4/0/code.py:36:#      或在 X 输入通道里预放一个 diamond（与原题同类的“远端已补全”情况）。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D4/0/code.py:38:#    - 关键可见差异是：实心块在输出里不再变成 diamond，而是变成 X。因为每题至少有 2 条 solid 通道，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D4/0/code.py:40:#    - 不使用颜色 id 做任何排序或变换；颜色只沿原通道对应传递。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D4/0/code.py:42:#    - 沿用原题的纵向通道和 sparse token 摆放；变体只交换 token 形状角色，不增加新叠层。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D4/0/code.py:48:#    - 假设 solid 通道的远端默认没有与待发射 diamond 冲突的同色残片；generator 对 solid 通道不预放远端图元。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D4/0/code.py:49:#    - 假设 X 通道若预放远端 diamond，也只是“已经完成的目标形状”，不会需要再次识别成源 token；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D4/3/code.py:3:# Change: 分解（decomposition）——实心3x3块被分解为十字形（中心+4个正交邻居，留在原位）和四角星形（4个对角角，... → L形分解\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/20/code.py:3:# Name: 非正方形网格+密集宽通道\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/16/code.py:11:#   A 1-pixel black rectangular container had a maroon head line on one side and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/16/code.py:12:#   a same-shape maroon destination line farther away on the movement axis.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/16/code.py:15:#   1. The destination is no longer a line. It is a maroon L or T marker.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/16/code.py:43:# - A simple nearest maroon line match is unsafe: we must parse marker anchors and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/16/code.py:65:# - The maroon head and marker never touch in the input, so the two roles stay legible.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/16/code.py:73:# - Every container has a full-edge 1-pixel maroon head adjacent to exactly one side.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/16/code.py:74:# - Every destination marker is a separate maroon component analyzable as an L or T.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D4/2/code.py:3:# Change: 分解（decomposition）——实心3x3块被分解为十字形（中心+4个正交邻居，留在原位）和四角星形（4个对角角，... → 镜像对称分解\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/9/code.py:26:# - D6/2: heads and targets are no longer globally maroon. Each mover uses its own visible marker\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/16/code.py:3:# Name: 紧凑裁剪+稀疏窄通道\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/16/code.py:19:      原题输入是整张方形背景图，蓝色通道占比较大，黑色 n×n 方块沿可容纳整个 n×n\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/16/code.py:24:      1. 输入端：通道改成稀疏细线式结构，整张输入里只有 10%-20% 的非背景像素，绝大多数\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/16/code.py:26:      2. 输出端：先按原滑动规则得到整张结果，再把结果裁成“包含整条通道区域的最小矩形”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/16/code.py:32:      与原题相比，解题者现在要同时看出“黑块在窄通道里的移动/受阻规则”和“输出把整条\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/16/code.py:33:      通道外的背景边框全部裁掉”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/16/code.py:36:      - 如果只做裁剪，不约束通道稀疏度，输入和输出差异会弱化成“去掉一点边框”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/16/code.py:38:      - 因此生成器同时强制：输入稀疏、输出必然变小、且通道仍要有 >=3 次转折，避免退化成\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/16/code.py:49:      - BFS 仍然在 n×n 顶点放置网格上进行；D14/0 没有改变物理规则，只是把大部分通道做成\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/16/code.py:64:      3. 输出只保留通道所在的紧凑矩形，而不是原始大画布。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/16/code.py:69:      - 路径被限制为非自接触折线，避免生成大块蓝团导致“哪里是通道、哪里是宽水面”不清。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/6/code.py:43:    - 输入放置逻辑沿用原题 output-first：先造蓝色通道，再放 mover / dest。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/6/code.py:45:    - generator 在放置后重算 feasible placement，并要求 solver 输出与内部 oracle 一致，防止重叠、越界或非法通道宽度漏网。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/6/code.py:48:      - 黑色不再“瞬移”，而是沿通道连续留下轨迹。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/6/code.py:50:    - 规则依赖几何可见条件“能否穿过宽度 >= n 的通道”，不依赖颜色编号排序。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/10/code.py:9:#      maroon head lines, and one maroon destination line.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/21/code.py:21:# - Outside the container there is now a 3x3 maroon arrow head plus a matching\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/21/code.py:22:#   3x3 maroon destination arrow further along the travel direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/21/code.py:33:#     * solver must infer R from the interior, then find the matching maroon\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf9