ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/31/code.py:3:# Name: 十字形色块+单轴对称+隐式端口\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D14/1/code.py:63:#       - the pipe network is entirely cyan/8, with no grey or maroon helper colors\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/14/code.py:12:  magenta background, black rectangular container, one maroon head line on a\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/14/code.py:13:  border side, and one matching maroon destination line on the same axis.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/12/code.py:9:#   rectangular container, grey/orange interior, one maroon head line adjacent to\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/12/code.py:10:#   one edge, and one matching maroon destination line farther along the movement\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/12/code.py:21:#      maroon, creating a docking seam. Otherwise the moved head stays maroon.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/12/code.py:23:#   original: clear old box/head -> paste moved box -> paste moved maroon head.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/12/code.py:26:#             moved maroon head.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/12/code.py:39:#   full reach -> black seam, partial reach -> maroon head.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/12/code.py:49:#   maroon. Both are broken by the fusion:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/12/code.py:68:#   lose the maroon head in favor of a black docking edge.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/12/code.py:82:#   maroon front line -> black happens only on visible contact with the destination;\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D14/2/code.py:23:#     - 原任务里，一个通道从顶端到第一个交叉前始终是 8，交叉附近可能出现少量 5 标记，但它们只用于提示“直行”，不是新的段。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D14/2/code.py:30:#   - N 保持 4-5 个通道，颜色切换会在同一网格中重复多次，足以支持人类从少量样例归纳“经过一层交叉后换色”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/review/a47bf94d_parent_review_manual.md:40:  - 说明：通道拓